sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant G as Gateway
    participant A as Auth
    participant P as Privacy
    participant R as Router
    participant V as Provider Adapter
    participant U as Upstream Provider
    participant B as Billing
    participant E as Event Bus

    C->>G: POST /v1/chat/completions
    G->>A: Validate API key and scopes
    A-->>G: Principal, limits, policy context
    G->>P: Classify and transform request
    P-->>G: Privacy decision and eligible provider classes
    G->>R: Select route under policy and budget
    R-->>G: Route decision and fallback chain
    G->>V: Normalized invocation
    V->>U: Provider request
    U-->>V: Response or stream chunks
    V-->>G: Normalized response, usage, provider ID
    G-->>C: Normalized response or SSE chunks
    G->>B: Usage and cost event
    G->>E: Request, route, privacy, and provider events
    B-->>E: Billing ledger event
